WEBVTT

00:00:09.874 --> 00:00:13.049
The start page shows how you are doing and what to do today.

00:00:13.099 --> 00:00:18.254
At the top: today's advice. Your AI coach decides the colour, the safety and the reasons; without valid advice the fixed rules give it, and say why.

00:00:18.304 --> 00:00:24.506
Under 'Why this advice': the reasons, why the advice changed, where it comes from and where your AI coach and the rules differ.

00:00:24.556 --> 00:00:28.662
The colour and what it means. Once today's training is done, it says 'Done for today', with your recovery in a small line.

00:00:28.712 --> 00:00:34.601
When new data comes in, like your check-in or a workout, your AI coach makes a new version. Here it says when and why: 'Updated, after your check-in'. You only get a notice when the advice really changes.

00:00:34.651 --> 00:00:39.137
When a second AI coach works with you, its second opinion is listed here. Where it differs from your AI coach, you see it at once. Your own AI coach has the last word.

00:00:39.187 --> 00:00:46.818
VibeSynergy checks every night. When a measurement looks wrong, you see why here, and that night's sleep, HRV or readiness don't count for the advice.

00:00:46.868 --> 00:00:54.105
You decide: 'No, it's right' counts the night after all, 'Yes, incomplete' leaves it out. You can always undo it.

00:00:54.155 --> 00:00:57.855
Update advice first syncs all your sources, then asks your AI coach for new advice.

00:00:57.905 --> 00:01:02.214
Once your AI coach has made tomorrow's advice in the evening, it is here, with its colour and the day it is for. The notice names the same day.

00:01:02.264 --> 00:01:05.920
Recovery compares HRV, sleep and resting heart rate with your normal.

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:16.268
Fill in the check-in every morning: 1 to 5 per question.

00:01:16.318 --> 00:01:25.511
Your answers are saved right away.

00:01:25.561 --> 00:01:29.659
A note helps your AI coach refine the advice.

00:01:29.709 --> 00:01:35.510
Use ‹ and › or the date to move to other days.

00:01:35.560 --> 00:01:44.553
Further down: last night, body, timeline and best efforts.
